# --- Database ---
# NEVER commit these. The SQLite file holds real user rows including Argon2
# password hashes and email addresses, and this repository is public. Offline
# cracking a leaked hash dump is a real attack, not a theoretical one.
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

